This software contains dependencies with the following open-source projects.

This version of the testbed focuses on Qwen3-VL / Qwen3.6 visual tokenizer
down-placement (terminal-side video decode + processor + ViT, uploading a
precomputed embedding bundle), dynamic token pruning (VidCom2 retention
ratio), fp8 bundle-feature quantization, concurrent multi-user test
scenarios (barrier-aligned waves over lock-free SGLang engine sidecars), and
the One-D-Piece image-token link over lossy UDP, evaluated with Qwen3-VL on
MMBench. The retired split-inference and Mage-VL links have been removed.
The third-party components listed below remain in use.

